   "stem_html": "The most significant reason Hamilton makes the argument in the excerpt is to",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1168552,
     "content_html": "argue for federal assumption of state debt"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168553,
     "content_html": "justify the Constitution’s authorization of the collection of taxes by the federal government"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168551,
